  "question": {
    "text": "Upon treatment with ammoniacal&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mtext>S</mtext> </mrow> </math>, the metal ion that precipitates as a sulphide is",
